> does apply too.
>

The x3 of sepli is the thing doing the seperating. In the English
definition at least (It doesn't have a Lojban definition yet) the
applicable te sepli are any of "partition/wall/gap/interval/separating
medium".

Would you disagree that {mi do sepli loka clabra}? (I probably could have
come up with something better for "great distance", but meh.)


